      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افتزّ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, O) <i>overcame;</i> (K;) or
<i>was,</i> or <i>became, powerful,</i> or <i>strong, and overcame:</i> (O:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابتزّ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابتذّ</span> signify the same:
so in the Nawádir. (O, TA.)

